 most.\", \"long_own\": \"A reason in your words\", \"long_title\": \"Thinking further ahead, what are your reasons not to?\", \"long_title_leave\": \"Getting away to be safe isn't what this card is for. Otherwise, what are your reasons not to?\", \"next\": \"Next\", \"pull_hint\": \"Pick the one that keeps coming back.\", \"pull_own\": \"Say it your way\", \"pull_title\": \"Which pull is this card for?\", \"reach_line\": \"Please reach out to someone now, using the support on this screen. You don't have to hold this alone.\", \"safe_hint\": \"You can answer honestly. Whatever you say, the support stays on the screen.\", \"safe_title\": \"Thank you for saying it. Right now, are you safe from acting on it?\", \"safety_open\": \"Talk to someone now\", \"settle_line\": \"Settle first. The card can wait until you're steadier.\"}", s.tablesJson = "{}", s.deriveJson = "[]";
