around you. Tap for each one.\", \"find_title\": \"Give your eyes a job.\", \"fork_hint\": \"Any answer is fine.\", \"fork_title\": \"Can anything be done about this right now?\", \"found\": \"Found one\", \"heard\": \"Heard one\", \"held_offer\": \"A hand on my heart\", \"listen_task\": \"Listen. Tap for each sound you can hear, near or far.\", \"listen_title\": \"Now give your ears one.\", \"lower_cue\": \"Nothing to do. Watch the ring and breathe however you breathe.\", \"lower_cue_here\": \"Nothing to do. Eyes open, feet on the floor.\", \"lower_done\": \"You got through two minutes.\", \"lower_running\": \"Two minutes\", \"lower_title\": \"You don't have to make this go away. Let's get through the next two minutes.\", \"medical_line\": \"Sit or lie down. Even if it eases, get it checked today.\", \"move_caution\": \"Go at your own pace. Slow down or stop if anything hurts.\", \"move_done\": \"That's a minute. Let your breath settle.\", \"move_running\": \"Keep going\", \"move_start\": \"Tap to start\", \"move_step1\": \"Stand up and march on the spot, knees high.\", \"move_step2\": \"Or go up and down the stairs.\", \"move_title\": \"Move fast for a minute.\", \"next\": \"Next\", \"notice_offer\": \"A minute noticing what's around you\", \"orient_done\": \"You're here.\", \"orient_here\": \"You're here, and it's\", \"orient_task\": \"Find three things you can see. Tap for each one.\", \"orient_title\": \"Eyes open. Look around you.\", \"press_done\": \"Three presses.\", \"press_hint\": \"Keep a thumb on the circle while you press. Let go whenever you need to.\", \"press_label\": \"Press and hold\", \"press_running\": \"Push\", \"press_title\": \"Press the phone hard between your palms.\", \"safety_open\": \"Talk to someone now\", \"someone_line\": \"If you want someone with you right now, you can call or text one of these.\", \"squeeze_done\": \"That's three.\", \"squeeze_label\": \"Squeeze\", \"squeeze_start\": \"Press and hold to squeeze\", \"squeeze_step1\": \"Breathe in and squeeze your hands, arms and shoulders.\", \"squeeze_step2\": \"Breathe out and let it all drop.\", \"squeeze_still1\": \"Squeeze your hands, arms and shoulders.\", \"squeeze_still2\": \"Then let it all drop. Breathe however you breathe.\", \"squeeze_title\": \"Squeeze, then let it drop.\", \"state_hint\": \"Tap the closest one.\", \"state_title\": \"What's it like right now?\", \"strong_cue\": \"Hold something cold, or smell something strong. Feet into the floor.\", \"strong_title\": \"Something strong.\", \"tight_hint\": \"Can't tell is a full answer.\", \"tight_title\": \"How does your body feel now?\", \"urge_line\": \"First, a way to wait it out.\", \"wake_cue\": \"Rub your hands together fast until they're warm. Then shake them out.\", \"wake_title\": \"Wake your hands up.\"}", s.tablesJson = "{}", s.deriveJson = "[]";
