"name_end\": \"You found one. Noticing it is the practice.\", \"name_end_kept\": \"It's in Things I like. A list like that grows slowly, one thing at a time.\", \"name_end_title\": \"Found one.\", \"name_hint\": \"Pick the closest, or name it in a few words.\", \"name_own\": \"Name it\", \"name_title\": \"What was it?\", \"next\": \"Next\", \"no_line\": \"A smaller one tomorrow still counts.\", \"no_low\": \"If energy's been low for a while, Running low looks at sleep, food and the body.\", \"no_title\": \"That's okay.\", \"pick_hint\": \"If nothing sounds good, that's part of feeling low. Pick the one that sounds least bad.\", \"pick_own\": \"Something else\", \"pick_title\": \"Pick one good thing.\", \"picture_done\": \"That's the bit to look forward to.\", \"picture_hint\": \"Where you are, what you can see and hear, the bit you'd like most. If nothing comes, picturing where you'll be is enough.\", \"picture_label\": \"Start\", \"picture_running\": \"Picturing it\", \"picture_title\": \"Pick one of your good things. Picture the best ten seconds of it.\", \"picture_title_1\": \"{wk1}: picture the best ten seconds of it.\", \"profile_unnamed\": \"something you like\", \"remind_label\": \"Want me to ask how it went?\", \"safety_open\": \"Talk to someone now\", \"set_line\": \"Doing it counts, whether or not you enjoy it.\", \"set_remind\": \"I'll ask how it went. Doing it counts, whether or not you enjoy it.\", \"set_title\": \"Your good thing: {pick}.\", \"settle_line\": \"This will keep. Look after the next few minutes first.\", \"start_hint\": \"A minute is enough.\", \"start_title\": \"Where do you want to start?\", \"start_title_savour\": \"Where do you want to start?\", \"stay_done\": \"You noticed it. That counts.\", \"stay_hint\": \"Let your eyes rest on it, or keep it in mind. Notice one thing you like about it. Let it be as big as it is; it doesn't have to last.\", \"stay_label\": \"Start\", \"stay_running\": \"Staying with it\", \"stay_title\": \"Stay with it for a few seconds. Notice one thing you like about it.\", \"stay_title_savour\": \"Stay with what's good for a few seconds. Notice one thing you like about it.\", \"week_hint\": \"If nothing sounds good, that's part of feeling low. Pick one that feels doable. One is plenty.\", \"week_set_line\": \"I'll check in on the evening of each day. Doing it counts, whether or not you enjoy it.\", \"week_set_title\": \"Your good things are planned.\", \"week_set_title_1\": \"Your good thing is planned.\", \"week_title_1\": \"Pick a good thing for this week.\", \"week_title_2\": \"And another?\", \"week_title_3\": \"One more?\", \"when_title\": \"When will you do it?\"}", s.tablesJson = "{}", s.deriveJson = "[]";
